{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19104310","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19104310","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:0:1910431001:1":{"text":"你们尝试安抚歌尼特，但他只是尖叫、尖叫、尖叫。","source_cn":"你们尝试安抚歌尼特，但他只是尖叫、尖叫、尖叫。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xDE85880E5169EBF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1910431002:1":{"text":"你能感受到他的情绪一潭死水。他的心中没有恶意，没有仇恨，甚至没有愤怒。","source_cn":"你能感受到他的情绪一潭死水。他的心中没有恶意，没有仇恨...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x4BC95F261259E6AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910431003:0":{"text":"那里只有最远古的、最无需掩盖的冲动——<style=\"highlight2\">饥饿</style>……","source_cn":"那里只有最远古的、最无需掩盖的冲动——<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD99FCBD3CF5428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1910431004:0":{"text":"你们束手无策，只能先回房休息，在不安中度过了一夜……","source_cn":"你们束手无策，只能先回房休息，在不安中度过了一夜……","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x3C3691F9BFE489FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:旁白":{"text":"旁白","source":"旁白","status":"source"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黑屏字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}